    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level\u2019s objective. Be careful \u2014 over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can pass levels by moving freely, or by carefully planning the best strategy. If you complete a level with the minimum number of moves, you'll earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels can be solved in under 10 moves, and all levels can be completed in under 30. There's no need to overthink \u2014 sometimes a bit of cleverness or trimming a few unnecessary steps is all it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy at your own pace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level\u2019s objective. Be careful \u2014 over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can pass levels by moving freely, or by carefully planning the best strategy. If you complete a level with the minimum number of moves, you'll earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels can be solved in under 10 moves, and all levels can be completed in under 30. There's no need to overthink \u2014 sometimes a bit of cleverness or trimming a few unnecessary steps is all it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy at your own pace.</p>",
